VABAR runs on RoboSimStudio (https://github.com/robosimstudio/robosimstudio),
Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 Kaiyuan Chen, installed as a dependency.
vabar/_upstream/bench_run.py is RoboSimStudio's scripts/bench_run.py, copied
unmodified because the RoboSimStudio wheel does not ship its scripts/.

This distribution includes third-party robot models. Each keeps its own
licence, in a LICENSE file beside the files it covers:

assets/embodiments/robotiq_2f85/
    Robotiq 2F-85 gripper, from MuJoCo Menagerie
    (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie). BSD 2-Clause
    License. Copyright (c) 2013, ROS-Industrial.

assets/embodiments/ur5/
    Universal Robots UR5, from ROS-Industrial universal_robot. BSD 3-Clause
    License. Copyright 2018 ROS Industrial Consortium.

assets/embodiments/yam/i2rt_yam/
assets/embodiments/yam_i2rt/
assets/embodiments/linear_4310/
    i2rt YAM arm and linear_4310 gripper (https://github.com/i2rt-robotics/i2rt).
    MIT License. Copyright (c) I2RT Robotics.

assets/embodiments/panda/
    Franka Emika Panda kinematics, identical to the file RoboSimStudio ships;
    see RoboSimStudio's NOTICE for its provenance (robosuite, MIT;
    example-robot-data, BSD 3-Clause; franka_description, Apache 2.0).

Object meshes, fixtures and scans are listed with their sources, and with the
licences still to be confirmed, in ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.

isaaclab_arena/ runs VABAR on Isaac Lab Arena. Licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). Files whose header names "The Isaac Lab Arena Project
Developers" derive from Isaac Lab Arena
(https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab-Arena), Apache License 2.0. The OmniPBR
and OmniGlass material files (*.mdl) bundled with its object assets are
under the BSD 3-Clause License, as stated in each file.

isaaclab_arena/ includes generated robot USDs of third-party robot models.
Each keeps its own licence, in a LICENSE file beside the files it covers.
Paths are under isaaclab_arena/isaaclab_arena_vabar/src/isaaclab_arena_vabar/assets/:

vabar__i2rt_yam/
    i2rt YAM arm, generated robot USD of MuJoCo Menagerie's i2rt_yam
    (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie @ 71f066ad). MIT
    License. Copyright (c) 2025 i2rt robotics.

vabar__i2rt_yam/linear_4310/
    linear_4310 gripper, generated robot USD of this repository's
    assets/embodiments/linear_4310. MIT License. Copyright (c) I2RT Robotics.

vabar__fr3_robotiq_2f85/
    Franka Research 3, generated robot USD of MuJoCo Menagerie's franka_fr3.
    Apache License 2.0.
    Robotiq 2F-85 gripper, generated robot USD of MuJoCo Menagerie's
    robotiq_2f85_v4. BSD 2-Clause License. Copyright (c) 2013, ROS-Industrial.
    Franka hand, generated robot USD of MuJoCo Menagerie's
    franka_emika_panda/hand.xml. Apache License 2.0.
    Licence texts copied unchanged from
    https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie @ 71f066ad.

vabar__cable_routing_board/
vabar__cable_routing_peg/
    Cable-management board and pegs from the ManipulationNet Cable Management
    Benchmark (https://github.com/ManipulationNet/mnet_client). Apache License
    2.0.

Its object meshes and fixtures are listed with their sources in
ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.
